{"type":"text","timestamp":1794339122136,"sessionID":"ses_e390f5f67ffeyzZwSqPLXNKUwZ","part":{"id":"prt_1c6f22bb2001C0DNyc45qHGySE","messageID":"msg_1c6f22030001BBf9yfhdVmmx9u","sessionID":"ses_e390f5f67ffeyzZwSqPLXNKUwZ","type":"text","text":"<think>Network access works for npm and pip. Good.\n\nNow let me plan the work with a todo list.\n\nPlan:\n1. Backend: implement app.py with SQLite storage, auth, lockout, rate limit, admin.\n2. Frontend: install Tailwind, build pages.\n3. Build & test locally (run flask/gunicorn, run API tests).\n4. Build the Docker image and verify (docker may not be available in the sandbox — check).\n\nLet me check for docker availability.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794339122098,"end":1794339122132}}}
